#: ../../../nexus-io36-native-20261018/docs/explanation/rtc-lptim.md:10
msgid "RTC and LPTIM: separate time domains and retained requests"
msgstr "RTC and LPTIM: separate time domains and retained requests"

#: ../../../nexus-io36-native-20261018/docs/explanation/rtc-lptim.md:12
msgid ""
"Use this explanation to integrate the Native raw-calendar RTC and finite-"
"counter LPTIM through static typed factory lookup and explicit Platform "
"lifecycle. One ordinary TOML assembly selects independent instances; public "
"calls enter the matching provider directly. This Native host-model scope "
"does not provide an MCU RTC/LPTIM driver, a product clock service or "
"hardware low-power continuity."
msgstr ""
"Use this explanation to integrate the Native raw-calendar RTC and finite-"
"counter LPTIM through static typed factory lookup and explicit Platform "
"lifecycle. One ordinary TOML assembly selects independent instances; public "
"calls enter the matching provider directly. This Native host-model scope "
"does not provide an MCU RTC/LPTIM driver, a product clock service or "
"hardware low-power continuity."

